<title>USA: RTRS-ASX substantial shareholding notices - March 17.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ASX substantial shareholding notices - March 17.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following substantial shareholder notices have been made to The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX).</p>
<p>Churchill Resources Holdings Pty Ltd increased its relevant interest in Churchill Resources NL on 12/03/1997, from 62,643,066 ordinary shares (58.05%) to 62,729,066 ordinary shares (58.13%).</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
